]:transition-transform [&amp;_video]:duration-200 **:data-media-overlay-text:scale-100 **:data-media-overlay-text:transition-transform **:data-media-overlay-text:duration-300 group-hover:[&amp;_img]:scale-102.5 group-hover:[&amp;_video]:scale-102.5 group-hover:**:data-media-overlay-text:scale-102.5 w-full mx-auto transition-opacity duration-medium ease-curve-c max-w-container-desktop relative min-h-0 overflow-hidden\">\n         <div class=\"relative min-h-0 w-full\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1/1\">\n          <div class=\"size-full\">\n           <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-none image-aspect-center aspect-(--image-aspect-ratio) max-h-full max-w-full bg-surface-loading\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio:1/1\">\n            <img alt=\"How workers are turning AI experimentation into new ways of working &gt; Cover image\" data-nosnippet=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center\" style=\"top:0;color:transparent;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1728px) 1728px, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_blog-art-card-option040-v001.png 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_blog-art-card-option040-v001.png 750w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_blog-art-card-option040-v001.png 828w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_blog-art-card-option040-v001.png 1080w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_blog-art-card-option040-v001.png 1200w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_blog-art-card-option040-v001.png 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_blog-art-card-option040-v001.png 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_blog-art-card-option040-v001.png 3840w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_blog-art-card-option040-v001.png\">\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <a aria-label=\"How workers are unlocking new ways of working - Global Affairs - Sep 16, 2026\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 block w-full pt-4 transition-[opacity,background] duration-medium ease-curve-d after:absolute after:inset-0 after:content-['']\" id=\"1lmAfLsPzJ765GAjE1HbOn\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/unlocking-new-ways-of-working/\"> \n         <div class=\"relative w-full text-primary-100\">\n          <div class=\"mb-4 text-h5\">How workers are unlocking new ways of working</div>\n          <p class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-2 text-meta\"><span>Global Affairs</span><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-2\"><time class=\"text-nowrap text-primary-60\" datetime=\"2026-09-16T09:00\">Sep 16, 2026</time></span></p>\n         </div> \n        </a>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"relative mb-8 ps-6 min-w-[calc(100%/3)] ps-0 last:me-0\">\n       <div class=\"group relative\">\n        <div class=\"rounded-md [&amp;_img]:translate-0 [&amp;_video]:translate-0 [&amp;_img]:scale-100 [&amp;_img]:transition-transform [&amp;_img]:duration-300 [&amp;_video]:transition-transform [&amp;_video]:duration-200 **:data-media-overlay-text:scale-100 **:data-media-overlay-text:transition-transform **:data-media-overlay-text:duration-300 group-hover:[&amp;_img]:scale-102.5 group-hover:[&amp;_video]:scale-102.5 group-hover:**:data-media-overlay-text:scale-102.5 w-full mx-auto transition-opacity duration-medium ease-curve-c max-w-container-desktop relative min-h-0 overflow-hidden\">\n         <div class=\"relative min-h-0 w-full\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1/1\">\n          <div class=\"size-full\">\n           <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-none image-aspect-center aspect-(--image-aspect-ratio) max-h-full max-w-full bg-surface-loading\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio:1/1\">\n            <img alt=\"Expanding AI access across every level of US government - listing image - Option 051\" data-nosnippet=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center\" style=\"top:0;color:transparent;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1728px) 1728px, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_government-blog-card-option-051-review-1080x1080.png 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_government-blog-card-option-051-review-1080x1080.png 750w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_government-blog-card-option-051-review-1080x1080.png 828w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_government-blog-card-option-051-review-1080x1080.png 1080w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_government-blog-card-option-051-review-1080x1080.png 1200w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_government-blog-card-option-051-review-1080x1080.png 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_government-blog-card-option-051-review-1080x1080.png 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_government-blog-card-option-051-review-1080x1080.png 3840w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260916225941_government-blog-card-option-051-review-1080x1080.png\">\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <a aria-label=\"Expanding AI access across every level of US government - Global Affairs - Sep 10, 2026\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 block w-full pt-4 transition-[opacity,background] duration-medium ease-curve-d after:absolute after:inset-0 after:content-['']\" id=\"4BZ43F23AKonQ3XM4cjxSB\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/expanding-ai-access-us-government/\"> \n         <div class=\"relative w-full text-primary-100\">\n          <div class=\"mb-4 text-h5\">Expanding AI access across every level of US government</div>\n          <p class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-2 text-meta\"><span>Global Affairs</span><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-2\"><time class=\"text-nowrap text-primary-60\" datetime=\"2026-09-10T00:00:00-07:00\">Sep 10, 2026</time></span></p>\n         </div> \n        </a>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "OpenAI 呼吁美国牵头全球努力，为前沿 AI 制定国际技术标准，涵盖递归自我改进，涉及评估、人类监督和事件报告。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "OpenAI 呼吁美国牵头全球努力，为前沿 AI 制定国际技术标准，涵盖递归自我改进，涉及评估、人类监督和事件报告。",
  "summary": "OpenAI 认为，前沿 AI 安全与保障的国际技术标准，对把控前沿发展节奏的重要性不亚于对齐研究本身。该公司列出了三项需要国际协调的挑战：各国评估和事件定义碎片化、集体行动问题——即各国独立决策产生不受欢迎的结果，以及全球前沿发展能力不均衡。OpenAI 提议由美国牵头制定全球技术标准，包含两个核心要素：一是利用新兴的 AI 安全研究所网络（分布于澳大利亚、加拿大、德国、法国、肯尼亚、日本、韩国、新加坡、印度和英国），通过 CAISI 和国家产业机构促进标准制定；二是共同的测量方法和事件报告协议。具体标准领域包括：评估与 RSI 相关的进展、自动化 AI 研究的人类监督触发条件，以及事件分类和报告阈值。OpenAI 强调，这些标准不是许可证，也不是强制性的发布前审查，应支持包括开放权重开发者在内的竞争性生态。文章还呼吁关键基础设施运营者与政府之间建立安全沟通渠道，包括美中对话。",
